        "zh": {
          "title": "波音Everett廠製造的737據報納入生產證書",
          "summary": "波音Everett廠製造的737據報納入生產證書，FAA稽覈進入最後階段。",
          "body": [
            "The Air Current於2026年11月23日報導，波音在Everett製造的737已納入該公司的PC700生產證書。報導指出，波音距離向客戶交付新North Line產線製造的737又近了一步。",
            "The Air Current引述熟悉波音動態的人士指出，波音目前正進行聯邦航空總署（FAA）稽覈的最後步驟。FAA也對這條產線最初製造的數架飛機進行額外檢查。",
            "波音表示，Everett製造的首架737 MAX於2026年10月下線。這條產線於2026年7月啟用。"
          ]
        },
        "en": {
          "title": "Boeing's Everett-built 737s reportedly added to production certificate",
          "summary": "Boeing's Everett-built 737s were reportedly added to its production certificate; an FAA audit is in its final stages.",
          "body": [
            "The Air Current reported on November 23, 2026, that Boeing 737s built at Everett had been added to the company's PC700 production certificate. The report said Boeing had moved a step closer to customer deliveries of 737 aircraft built at its new North Line facility in Everett.",
            "Citing people with knowledge of developments at Boeing, The Air Current said the manufacturer is moving through the final steps of a Federal Aviation Administration (FAA) audit. The FAA also conducted additional inspections on the first several aircraft built on the line.",
            "Boeing said the first 737 MAX manufactured in Everett rolled off the assembly line in October 2026. The line opened in July 2026."
          ]
        },
